# Scratch state written by unrelated local tooling into whatever directory it touches.
# These regenerated twice while staging this repo; one of them was a 1.5MB memory database.
# Re-check for them immediately before `git add` — a .gitignore only helps if it exists first.
.swarm/
.claude-flow/
ruvector.db
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

report.json
node_modules/
